{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["על האבנים — upon the birthing-stool. As we say: באו בנים עד משבר. And in the potter's vessel, Jeremiah wrote עושה מלאכה על האבנים." "וחיה — its meaning is as above, like מן שב שבה. From ארפרכשד, 'חיה' — one says for the female חיה, but these חיה a thousand years times, its meaning is below, and the masculine form is from the pattern עשה, עלה, ראה."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {1 "The lemma 'וחיה' relates to Exod 1:16; the grammatical examples (שב שבה, ארפרכשד) and the phrase 'these חיה a thousand years' are obscure and possibly corrupt in the manuscripts; rendered hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:40:10.523581204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}